<http://www.ease-crc.org/ont/llm_reasoner/cram-classes> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "The classes of a code base" ;
    rdfs:comment "Written from the live classes of a code base by llm_reasoner.world.class_ontology, which a selection file tells which classes to describe; write it again rather than editing it. Inheritance is Python inheritance through the classes described, mixins left out; a field is a property scoped to the class that adds it." .

