code:semantic_digital_twin.robots.robotiq_85_gripper.Robotiq85Gripper a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Robotiq85Gripper" ;
    code:pythonName "semantic_digital_twin.robots.robotiq_85_gripper.Robotiq85Gripper" ;
    rdfs:comment """A Robotiq 2F-85 parallel gripper: two fingers coupled by a mimic linkage, driven by
the knuckle joint of the thumb.

Knows what a grasp and a physical simulation need from it: the joint that drives
the fingers and the servo driving it; the pads that meet an object are the tips of
its thumb and finger.

The servo is raised empirically, since no pre-tuned reference exists for the
Robotiq 2F-85; its armature gives the coupled mechanism the numerical damping that
keeps it from chattering under load.""" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf code:semantic_digital_twin.robots.robot_part_mixins.HasTwoFingers,
        code:semantic_digital_twin.robots.robot_parts.EndEffector,
        code:semantic_digital_twin.robots.robot_parts.ServoedRobotPart .

